      "id": "PR_kwDOKIwiaM7LJJVV",
      "title": "chore: remove SuperchainERC20 references",
      "author": "sbvegan",
      "number": 2003,
      "body": "## Summary\n\n* Removes all SuperchainERC20 documentation in preparation for the Remote Controlled Token (RCT) standard, which is not yet finalized\n* Deletes 6 pages entirely (dedicated SuperchainERC20 tutorials, compatible tokens reference, and the starter kit quickstart which was SuperchainERC20-focused)\n* Adds redirects in `docs.json` for all removed URLs → `/op-stack/interop/interop`\n* Updates 12 existing legacy redirects that previously pointed to the removed pages\n* Makes surgical inline edits across ~17 files to remove SuperchainERC20 mentions while preserving surrounding interop content\n\n**Deleted pages:**\n- `op-stack/interop/superchain-erc20.mdx`\n- `app-developers/tutorials/tokens/custom-superchain-erc20.mdx`\n- `app-developers/tutorials/tokens/deploy-superchain-erc20.mdx`\n- `app-developers/tutorials/tokens/transfer-superchainERC20.mdx`\n- `app-developers/quickstarts/starter-kit.mdx`\n- `app-developers/reference/tokens/compatible-tokens.mdx`\n\n## Test plan\n\n* [ ] Preview locally with `pnpm dev` and verify removed pages redirect correctly to `/op-stack/interop/interop`\n* [ ] Confirm no broken internal links remain to the deleted pages\n* [ ] Spot-check interop guides to confirm surrounding content is intact\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/docs",
      "createdAt": "2026-03-17T08:10:43Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-03-17T08:17:14Z",
      "additions": 68,
      "deletions": 498
    },
